  "contentHtml": "<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span data-ke-size=\"size18\">안녕하세요. 지난번, <b>플레이메이커</b>로 <b>방탈출</b>을 소개해드렸었습니다.</span></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span data-ke-size=\"size18\"><a href=\"https://cafe.daum.net/sedu22/F1n/846\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"ke-link\">https://cafe.daum.net/sedu22/F1n/846</a></span></p><div class=\"figure-open\" contenteditable=\"false\" data-ke-type=\"opengraph\" data-ke-align=\"alignCenter\" data-og-type=\"website\" data-og-title=\"Daum 카페\" data-og-description=\"\" data-og-host=\"cafe.daum.net\" data-og-source-url=\"https://cafe.daum.net/sedu22/F1n/846\" data-og-url=\"https://cafe.daum.net/_c21_/bbs_read?grpid=1TaBA&amp;fldid=F1n&amp;datanum=846\" data-og-image=\"//img1.kakaocdn.net/thumb/C200x200/?fname=https%3A%2F%2Ft1.daumcdn.net%2Fcafe_image%2Fcafe_meta_image_190529.png\"><a href=\"https://cafe.daum.net/sedu22/F1n/846\" target=\"_blank\" data-source-url=\"https://cafe.daum.net/sedu22/F1n/846\"><div class=\"og-image\"><img class=\"thumb_img\" src=\"//img1.kakaocdn.net/thumb/C200x200/?fname=https%3A%2F%2Ft1.daumcdn.net%2Fcafe_image%2Fcafe_meta_image_190529.png\" alt=\"\" xxxxonerror=\"this.src=&quot;//img1.kakaocdn.net/thumb/C200x200/?fname=https%3A%2F%2Ft1.daumcdn.net%2Fcafe_image%2Fcafe_meta_image_190529.png&quot;\"></div><div class=\"og-text\"><p class=\"og-title\">Daum 카페</p><p class=\"og-desc\"></p><p class=\"og-host\">cafe.daum.net</p></div></a></div><p style=\"text-align: center;\">&#160;</p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span data-ke-size=\"size18\">이번에 <b>황선욱(부산) 선생님</b>께서 만들어주신 </span></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span data-ke-size=\"size18\">중2 과학 열과 우리생활 구글 폼 방탈출을 플레이메이커로 변경해봤습니다.</span></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\">&#160;</p><p style=\"text-align: center;\">&#160;</p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span data-ke-size=\"size18\">황선욱(부산) 선생님의 방탈출 제작 능력에 정말 경의를 표합니다.</span></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span data-ke-size=\"size18\">스토리와 문항들이 모두 감탄만 나왔습니다. </span></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span data-ke-size=\"size18\">이러한 자료를 플레이메이커로 변환하여 소개할 수 있게 허락해주셔서 감사드립니다.</span></p><div data-ke-type=\"emoticon\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-emoticon-type=\"friends1\" data-emoticon-name=\"008\" data-emoticon-isanimation=\"false\" data-emoticon-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/keditor/emoticon/friends1/large/008.gif\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/keditor/emoticon/friends1/large/008.gif\"></div><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span data-ke-size=\"size18\"><a href=\"https://cafe.daum.net/sedu22/Hzi/2380\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"ke-link\">https://cafe.daum.net/sedu22/Hzi/2380</a></span></p><div class=\"figure-open\" contenteditable=\"false\" data-ke-type=\"opengraph\" data-ke-align=\"alignCenter\" data-og-type=\"website\" data-og-title=\"Daum 카페\" data-og-description=\"\" data-og-host=\"cafe.daum.net\" data-og-source-url=\"https://cafe.daum.net/sedu22/Hzi/2380\" data-og-url=\"https://cafe.daum.net/_c21_/bbs_read?grpid=1TaBA&amp;fldid=Hzi&amp;datanum=2380\" data-og-image=\"//img1.kakaocdn.net/thumb/C200x200/?fname=https%3A%2F%2Ft1.daumcdn.net%2Fcafe_image%2Fcafe_meta_image_190529.png\"><a href=\"https://cafe.daum.net/sedu22/Hzi/2380\" target=\"_blank\" data-source-url=\"https://cafe.daum.net/sedu22/Hzi/2380\"><div class=\"og-image\"><img class=\"thumb_img\" src=\"//img1.kakaocdn.net/thumb/C200x200/?fname=https%3A%2F%2Ft1.daumcdn.net%2Fcafe_image%2Fcafe_meta_image_190529.png\" alt=\"\" xxxxonerror=\"this.src=&quot;//img1.kakaocdn.net/thumb/C200x200/?fname=https%3A%2F%2Ft1.daumcdn.net%2Fcafe_image%2Fcafe_meta_image_190529.png&quot;\"></div><div class=\"og-text\"><p class=\"og-title\">Daum 카페</p><p class=\"og-desc\"></p><p class=\"og-host\">cafe.daum.net</p></div></a></div><p style=\"text-align: center;\">&#160;</p><p style=\"text-align: center;\">&#160;</p><p style=\"text-align: center;\">&#160;</p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span data-ke-size=\"size18\">학생들에게 아래 링크를 QR코드와 같은 방법으로 제공하면 바로 플레이 가능하십니다.</span></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span data-ke-size=\"size18\">대부분의 정답은 황선욱(부산)선생님의 정답과 동일합니다. </span></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span data-ke-size=\"size18\">따라서 <span style=\"color: #ee2323;\"><b>구글폼을 확인하시면 모든 문제와 답을 확인하실 수 있습니다.</b></span></span></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\">&#160;</p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span data-ke-size=\"size18\"><a href=\"https://playthe.world/themes/DXKSjAtSfY7mUjVFKRTK\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"ke-link\">https://playthe.world/themes/DXKSjAtSfY7mUjVFKRTK</a></span></p><div class=\"figure-open\" contenteditable=\"false\" data-ke-type=\"opengraph\" data-ke-align=\"alignCenter\" data-og-type=\"website\" data-og-title=\"열 단원 방탈출 - 플레이더월드\" data-og-description=\"[2022개정] 중학교 1학년 3단원\" data-og-host=\"playthe.world\" data-og-source-url=\"https://playthe.world/themes/DXKSjAtSfY7mUjVFKRTK\" data-og-url=\"https://playthe.world/themes/DXKSjAtSfY7mUjVFKRTK\" data-og-image=\"https://scrap.kakaocdn.net/dn/bCBq8r/hyYHbHtFTz/6vU1iCaZK1Z8zSB6Vcjvp1/img.png?width=500&amp;height=500&amp;face=0_0_500_500\"><a href=\"https://playthe.world/themes/DXKSjAtSfY7mUjVFKRTK\" target=\"_blank\" data-source-url=\"https://playthe.world/themes/DXKSjAtSfY7mUjVFKRTK\"><div class=\"og-image\"><img class=\"thumb_img\" src=\"https://scrap.kakaocdn.net/dn/bCBq8r/hyYHbHtFTz/6vU1iCaZK1Z8zSB6Vcjvp1/img.png?width=500&amp;height=500&amp;face=0_0_500_500\" alt=\"\" xxxxonerror=\"this.src=&quot;//img1.kakaocdn.net/thumb/C200x200/?fname=https%3A%2F%2Ft1.daumcdn.net%2Fcafe_image%2Fcafe_meta_image_190529.png&quot;\"></div><div class=\"og-text\"><p class=\"og-title\">열 단원 방탈출 - 플레이더월드</p><p class=\"og-desc\">[2022개정] 중학교 1학년 3단원</p><p class=\"og-host\">playthe.world</p></div></a></div><p style=\"text-align: center;\">&#160;</p><p style=\"text-align: center;\">&#160;</p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span data-ke-size=\"size18\">초반 입장 비밀번호는 1709입니다.</span></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\">&#160;</p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span data-ke-size=\"size18\">마지막 정답은 열쇠-문-커피포트 순서로 선택하면 정답입니다.</span></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span data-ke-size=\"size18\">열쇠를 문에 꽂고 커피포트의 뜨거운물을 부어 팽창시킨다는 느낌...?</span></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\">&#160;</p><p style=\"text-align: center;\">&#160;</p><p style=\"text-align: center;\">&#160;</p><p style=\"text-align: center;\">&#160;</p><p style=\"text-align: center;\">&#160;</p>\n\t \t\t\t\t\t<!-- -->",
